  {
   "sid": "s7",
   "date": "2025-04-04",
   "url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/newsevents/speech/barr20250404a.htm",
   "text": "Given rapid advances in Gen AI every quarter, in the not-too-distant future, we may approach a point at which Gen AI becomes an imperative—a competitive necessity—in banking.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Michael S. Barr",
